{"material_id": "ntce.chuzhong.meishu.2019a.q26.material.recovered", "text": "阅读案例，并回答问题。 胡老师教授《艺术大师毕加索》一课时，幽默地将毕加索比作“天才”（从小就有绘画天赋）、“小偷”（偷师前辈画家的创作思路）、“变形金刚”（作品风格变化多样）和“疯子”（作品让很多人看不懂），并问学生：这样的“怪胎”你们喜欢吗？整堂课胡老师还讲了毕加索很多逸闻趣事，学生们听得津津有味。 胡老师对自己的教学方式很满意，认为现在的学生课业负担很重，没有必要把美术课上得那么严肃，用幽默的语言能够拉近与学生的距离，这不正体现了美术课程的人文性和探究性学习的倡导吗？", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2019年上半年教师资格证考试《初中美术》真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "66ec64eee1c082078cb7da10519dcbb860b8fec4ceaa1ffa8cc56acafdf88118", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2170, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2409, "next_source_question_number": 31, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2019年上半年教师资格证考试《初中美术》真题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 26, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "66ec64eee1c082078cb7da10519dcbb860b8fec4ceaa1ffa8cc56acafdf88118"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.meishu.2019a.q26"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.meishu.s1.k02", "ntce.chuzhong.meishu.s1.k09", "ntce.chuzhong.meishu.s4.k01"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.ability.evaluate", "ntce.chuzhong.ability.manage", "ntce.chuzhong.ability.subject"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.314.r003", "ntce.outline.314.r013", "ntce.outline.314.r020", "ntce.outline.314.r032"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.chuzhong.meishu.2019a.q26"], "word_count": 239, "level": "chuzhong", "subject": "meishu", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/初中真题/2019年上半年教师资格证考试《初中美术》真题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2019年上半年教师资格证考试《初中美术》真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "66ec64eee1c082078cb7da10519dcbb860b8fec4ceaa1ffa8cc56acafdf88118", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2170, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2409, "next_source_question_number": 31, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_sectio